  "releaseNotes": "1.16.0: AW009 diagnostic (Scoped dependency captured by [HostedService]), [Validate] attribute (FluentValidation IValidator registration), [Interceptor] attribute (compile-time proxy generation with IAutoWireInterceptor). 1.15.0: Module property, Resilience on [HttpClient], AW008, RegistrationSummary. 1.14.0: AW007, [HttpClient], Roslyn code fixes. 1.13.0: AW006, [Options], enum keys, multi-assembly scan. 1.12.0: Condition/IncludeLazy. 1.11.0: [Factory]/AW005. 1.10.0: Convention scanning. 1.9.0: Profile. 1.8.0: Ordered decorators. 1.7.0: AW004. 1.6.0: IncludeSelf. 1.5.0: [HostedService]. 1.4.0: Decorators. 1.3.0: DuplicateStrategy/TryX. 1.2.0: Open generics. 1.0.0: Initial.",
